<div id="urduTextPath">زیارت امام حسین (ع)/لکھتے ہیں راویانِ جگر سوز یہ کلام</div>
<p>Likhthe Hain Raaviyaan-E Jigar Souz Ye Kalaam<br>
Jab Baad-E Asr Kat Gaya Ran Me Sar-E Imaam<br>
Lashkar Se Ibn-E Saad Ye Bola Bawaqt-E Shaam<br>
Manzoor Hai Hamen Ke Yahin Aaj Ho Maqaam</p>

<p> Ek Qaima Istaadah Huzoor-E Nigaah Ho<br>
 Shaabaash Isme Aal-E Rasool-E Panaah Ho</p>

<p>Ek Qaima Tab Alaaheda Ran Me Bapaa Huwa<br>
Isme Huwe Muqeem Aseeraan-E Karbala<br>
Taqseem Fouj-E Shaam Me Hone Lagi Ghizaa<br>
Har Qism Ke Ta Aam Mohayya The Jaabajaa</p>

<p> Asaaesh-E Ta- Aam Thi Har Bad Qisaal Ko<br>
 Aur Faaqa Teesra Tha Mohammed Ki Aal Ko</p>

<p>Bola Ye Ibn-E Saad Ke Lejaao Tum Shataab<br>
Chaalis Qaan Khaane Ke Aur Sard Jaam-E Aab<br>
Tab Aik Aik Ne Ye Umar Ko Diya Jawaab<br>
Kis Mu Se Aage Jaaen Ham Inse Haen Hijaab</p>

<p> Pyaaroun Ko Inke Samne Neze Lagaen Ham<br>
 Aur Haazri Bhi Unke Liye Leke Jaaen Ham</p>

<p>Inkaar Jab Ke Jaane Me Ek Aik Ne Kiya<br>
Phir Tho Umar Ne Zoujae Hurr Ko Talab Kiya<br>
Bola Ye Khaana Leke Too Ahle Haram Me Jaa<br>
Karna Meri Taraf Se Bahot Uzr-O Iltejaa</p>

<p> Shouhar Tera Hai Fidya Shah-E Mashraqain Ka<br>
 Dena Too Shaher Bano Ko Pursaa Hussain Ka</p>

<p>Zainab Phir Apne Dil Ko Ye Dene Lagi Qabar<br>
In Khaanoun Me Yaqeen Hai Shahidoun Ke Honge Sar<br>
Naagaah Boli Zoujae Hurr Paas Aan Kar<br>
Loundi Salaam Karti Hai Bibi Karo Nazar</p>

<p> Mai Aashiq-E Hussain Kaneez-E Butool Hoon<br>
 Mai Zoujae Harawal-E Sibt-E Rasool Hoon</p>

<p>Aaya Zabaane Zoujae Hurr Par Jo Hurr Ka Naam<br>
Taazeem Ko Khadi Huwi Wo Qhahar Imaam<br>
Boli Too Hurr Ki Zouja Hai Tujh Par Mera Salaam<br>
Haq Baqshe Hurr Ko Waah, Ajab Kar Gaya Wo Kaam</p>

<p> Pahle Qabar Na Toone Ki Zehra Ki Jaai Ko<br>
 Sar Nange Dar Pa Aathi Teri Paishwaai Ko</p>

<p>Ye Kahke Usko Apne Barabar Bithaaliya<br>
Chaadar Na Thi Jo Dhaanp Ke Mu Roi Khoob Sa<br>
Aankhoun Pa Haath Rakh Ke Lagi Rone Aur Kaha<br>
Pursa Mai Hurr Ka Dethi Hoon Too Saath De Meraa</p>

<p> Wo Roke Boli Naam Nalo Us Ghulaam Ka<br>
 Mai Tumko Dene Aai Hoon Pursaa Imaam Ka</p>

<p>Zainab Ne Roke Zoujae Hurr Se Ye Phir Kaha<br>
Baare Tumhaare Aane Ka Yaan Kya Sabab Huwa<br>
Ki Arz Usne Loundi Ki Qismath Huwi Rasaa<br>
Bheje Hain Ibn-E Saad Ne Ye Khaan Par Ghiza</p>

<p> Kahne Uske Khaane Se Hamraah Aai Hoon<br>
 Mai Haazri Hussain Ke Marne Ki Laal Hoon</p>